---
// src/components/AboutUs.astro
---
<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white border-y border-brand-100 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
          World-Class Quality. <br/>Worldwide Reach.
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Nestled in the heart of Tamil Nadu, EcoLyf brings the finest Indian sustainable craftsmanship to the global stage. We manage the supply of premium, sugarcane-fiber collections that define the future of sustainable dining.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Our focus is on delivering a refined, eco-friendly experience that meets international expectations. From our doorstep to yours, we provide a reliable alternative to single-use plastics without the logistical complexity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[550px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl">
        
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
          <img 
            src="/images/Mission.jpeg" 
            alt="EcoLyf Supply Operations" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-950/40 via-transparent to-brand-950/20 backdrop-brightness-90"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 w-full p-8 md:p-12">
          
          <div class="backdrop-blur-xl bg-white/70 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/40 shadow-2xl transition-all md:hover:bg-white/80 md:hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg mb-6">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Our Mission</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-900 leading-relaxed font-bold">
              To eliminate plastic waste by bringing high-grade, compostable solutions to every corner of the globe.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="backdrop-blur-xl bg-white/70 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/40 shadow-2xl transition-all md:hover:bg-white/80 md:hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg mb-6">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Our Vision</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-900 leading-relaxed font-bold">
              To become the world’s most trusted partner for sustainable solutions, recognized for our commitment to quality, the planet.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>